{"title":"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A rectangular field is half as wide as it is long and is completely enclosed by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> yards of fencing. The area in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/6/9f6f43eff34fa364eeca846bf1a99ec34c426ef0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\mathrm{A})\\ \\frac{x^2}2 \\qquad (\\mathrm{B})\\ 2x^2 \\qquad (\\mathrm{C})\\ \\frac{2x^2}9 \\qquad (\\mathrm{D})\\ \\frac{x^2}{18} \\qquad (\\mathrm{E})\\ \\frac{x^2}{72}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"419\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9ee4b825a2e36ae093ed7be5e4851ef453b34914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> be the width. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/3/ad34debc5b2e220a8280aa23f3e1e85639e318dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l = 2w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"14\" />, and the perimeter is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/1/5912065d8e8ad4ff3f183ed51081734508280956.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2(2w)+2w = 6w \\implies w = \\frac{x}6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"272\" height=\"33\" />. The area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/a/25a084769cac51726a9cd99cc8a089ea17410769.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$wl = w(2w) = 2w^2 = 2\\left(\\frac{x^2}{36}\\right) = \\frac{x^2}{18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"277\" height=\"43\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693c4044f8526a8179956e8ac7a3f2f9d61e2c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME\" title=\"1951 AHSME\">1951 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1951 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1951\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 